    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkitanapat naaipirta enkeeya oo lbolot",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa o Aron, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Teneeta oltung'ani enetukurrunye to sesen lenye aashu oltudutai aashu olpepedoi, neibelekenya aaku enkeeya oo lbolot to lchoni lo sesen lenye, neyakini ninye Aron olapolosani aashu obo loo layiok lenyena lelo apolosak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejur ilo apolosani ine netii olpepedoi olchoni to sesen lenye, naa teneibelekenyate ilpapit leine wueji netii olpepedoi lenye, aaiborru, nelioyu ina muoyian etugumo to sesen lenye, naa enkeeya oo lbolot ina, ore pee eidip olapolosani atujurro ninye, neibalunye ninye ajo oloiduruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake teneibor ilo pepedoi otii olchoni lo sesen lenye, nelioo ajo eitu eturoyu alang olchoni, neitu eibelekenya olpapita leine eitu eturoyu alang olchoni, neitu eibelekenya olpapita leine aiborru, neikenoo olapolosani ilo tamuoyiai nkolong'i naapishana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki olapolosani ajur ninye te nkolong e naapishana. Naa tenetujurro too nkonyek enyena ina muoyian, neitu eitoki ina muoyian aponari to lchoni neitoki olapolosani aikenoo ninye kulie olong'i naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olapolosani ajur ninye te nkolong e naapishana naa tenetunukunye ilo pepedoi neitu eitoki ina keeya adaari to lchoni, neibalunye olapolosani ajo meiduruk ninye; olpepedoi ake, neituku ninye ilkilani lenyena nesidanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tenetadaari ilo pepedoi to lchoni lo sesen, ina kata eidipa aitoduaai kewan to lapolosani te nkitukuoto enye; neigil ninye alotu dukuya olapolosani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejur olapolosani ninye, naa tenetubulayie ilo pepedoi to lchoni lo sesen lenye, netum olapolosani aibalunye nchere keiduruk enkeeya oo lbolot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Teneidimu oltung'ani enkeeya oo lbolot, neyakini ninye olapolosani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejur olapolosani ninye, naa tenetii enetukurrunye neibor olchoni lo sesen lenye, neibelekenyate ilpapit leine aaiborru, niewotiote ine wueji ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa enkeeya oo lbolot torrono natijing'a olchoni lo sesen lenye, neibalunye olapolosani ninye ajo keiduruk. Neikenoo olapolosani ninye aiwuang'ie to lorere amu keiduruk ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa teneipang'u ina keeya oo lbolot to lchoni lo sesen lenye, metaa eibulua enkeeya oo lbolot olchoni pooki lo sesen leilo tung'ani omuoi ebaiki endukuya o metabaiki nkejek, anaa enadol olapolosani ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejur olapolosani ninye, naa teneibulua ina keeya oo lbolot osesen lenye, pooki neibalunye ninye ajo eisidai meiduruk teina muoyian; eibelekenye pooki aiborru, metaa meiduruk ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tenelioyu ineewotiotate te ninye, neaku ninye oloiduruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejur olapolosani ine neiwotiote, neibalunye ninye ajo keiduruk, ore ewueji neiwotiote to sesen naa keiduruk; amu enkeeya oo lbolot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake teneitoki ine neiwotiote aibelekenya neiborru, nelotu ninye enetii olapolosani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejur olapolosani ninye, ore ake pee eibelekenya ina keeya aiborru, neibalunye olapolosani ilo tung'ani omuoi ajo meiduruk; eisidai ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
