          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa teneeta osesen ewueji neinosa enkima to lchoni lenye, ore ine wueji neinosa enkima neaku oltipoti, onyokie aashu oloibor, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejur olapolosani ine, ore pee eibelekenyate ilpapit leine aaiborru netugumo ine alang olchoni lo sesen, naa enkeeya o lbolot, ninye nayopua ina kinosata enkima, neibalunye olapolosani ninye ajo olo lduruk; enkeeya oo lbolot ena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tenejur olapolosani ine ore ilpapit leine neitu eiborru neitu egutu alang osesen, kake etunukunye, neikenoo olapolosani ninye aiwuang'ie nkolong'i naapishana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu olapolosani ajur ninye te nkolong e naapishana; naa teneibulayie to lchoni lo sesen lenye, neibalunye olapolosani ninye ajo oloiduruk naa keeta, enkeeya oo lbolot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake teneton ilo tipoti te wueji nebo nemeibulaa to sesen, kake etunukunye kake enetejia ake teina kinosata enkima neibalunye olapolosani ninye ajo meeta entioto; amu enkiporoi enkima ake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
