          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tenejing olduruk le nkeeya oo lbolot atua olkila, aa olkila loo ntare aashu olkila le kitani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tenaa oloripuno too usin anaa oloo nkarash naapuyiapui, anaa oloo lpapit loo ntare, anaa oloo ndapan, anaa ole pooki toki naitobiruaki too ndapan, anaa ole pooki toki naripuno too ndapan ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa tenelioyu naa enkeeya oo lbolot enyori anaa enyokie to lkila, aa taa olkila oripuno too usin, anaa oloo ntokitin naapuyiapui, anaa oloo lpapit loo ntare, anaa oloo ndapan, anaa ole pooki toki naitobiraki too ndapan, naa enkeeya oo lbolot naa kepuoi aaitodol olapolosani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo olapolosani ajur ina keeya, neikenoo ina naata enkeeya nkolong'i naapishana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki taa alo ajur ina keeya te nkolong e naapishana. Teneibulayie enkeeya ilo kila, oripuno anaa oloo ntokitin naapuyiapui, anaa oloo ndapan, o endapana naasishoreki keiduruk ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kelo ninye apejoo ilo kila, aa oloripuno too usin, arashu oloo ntokitin naapiyaya, anaa oloo lpapit loo ntare anaa ole kitani napuyiapui, anaa pooki toki oo ndapan, amu enkeeya torrono ina, naa kepejori te nkima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
